{"tmdb":1530062,"tagline":"","synopsis":"In a world teetering on chaos, elite assassin John Rico is the go-to solution when the government wants threats removed-quietly and permanently. But when a mission goes sideways, he's given one last shot at redemption: track down and eliminate Mason Ryker, the final ghost of the feared underground unit known as The Order of the Dragon. As Rico's mission leads him to a small, danger-ridden town in Serbia, the lines between good and evil begin to blur. Is Ryker the monster he's made out to be, or is there a deeper conspiracy at play? What begins as a black-and-white hit spirals into a moral storm-and time is running out.","directors":[{"name":"Vjekoslav Katušin","id":2982224}],"cast":[{"actor":"Ron Smoorenburg","role":"John Rico","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5oXVFByoJXq5WdelBb0uI5VEUak.jpg","tmdb":955264},{"actor":"Steven Seagal","role":"Mason Ryker","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/fGNIEpn3JqOckY3ahnJX9x3qA94.jpg","tmdb":23880},{"actor":"Michael Paré","role":"Henry Wyatt","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jxrXW8OL6hwJgtJgePdMO5yHuAM.jpg","tmdb":60650},{"actor":"Michel Qissi","role":"Commander Rouge","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zl64reyhHgnrDFcDWx7lNKaVfmm.jpg","tmdb":222508},{"actor":"Vjekoslav Katušin","role":"Silver","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bvsMDlMBPvBpujI7ZLamakovBQh.jpg","tmdb":2982224},{"actor":"David Kurzhal","role":"Jean Pierre","photo":null,"tmdb":4093599},{"actor":"Alona Hertha","role":"Valetina","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/mcXmoZwXesF4sUHyJ6xHPcwu9Xj.jpg","tmdb":3317063},{"actor":"Jenny Perris","role":"Marina","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/iplmZfEbfyUlJOgb62eWY8EPCZM.jpg","tmdb":2982222},{"actor":"Neb Chupin","role":"Scarface","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aK6MI2o2x3jeoVJM5Hj8Z5re4be.jpg","tmdb":1992209},{"actor":"Dong Hyun Yoon","role":"Tuan","photo":null,"tmdb":3526563},{"actor":"Nitharsan Manokaran","role":"Shahid Khan","pho